error: `Directory.watchAll` holds the thread until it is done, and an async function does not hold its thread
  `Directory.watchAll` waits for the disk
  the tasks of async functions share a few threads: one that holds its thread keeps the others from running
  --> error_watch_in_async.sg:4:33
 4 |     var watcher = try Directory.watchAll(".")
   |                                 ^^^^^^^^
  hint: `await Directory.watchAllAsync(".")` does the same work without holding the thread
